{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve exclusive groups declared by superclasses.** `getAnnotation` returns only a subclass's locally declared `@ExclusivePluginGroup`, hiding the inherited `durable-otel-view` group. A custom OTel subclass annotated for another group can therefore run alongside the opposite view. Walk the class hierarchy using declared annotations, validate every distinct group, and add a re-annotated OTel subclass test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc75wZxp","finding_digest":"488ae6563efff80f82cde7a55ca2edfff6ebc28bb26c97c66fcd100a280bcfbb","finding_id":"arf_v1_jcfomvr6774a7awn46svzixn77","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::validateexclusivegroups::superclass-group-shadowing","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::validateexclusivegroups::superclass-group-shadowing","line":35,"observation_digest":"224d59e006774a8cf98e7bf217bf960cc71e4e51127f5d65dfea4e101d3e5ded","observation_id":"aro_v1_ejgvtyago5fiz6moppzbpp4wbt","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-06T00:16:36Z","review_id":"arr_v1_dkubel2nacrmgtxnpivrahvtae","reviewed_base_sha":"6045c38025275782197b771642129532058b8ccb","reviewed_head_sha":"c04805f005e80e616fceeb6f76626d0bb72949fc","reviewer":"codex","start_line":35,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":766},"record_id":"art_v1_d5fhizep3iawzf2zamr4spgcsk","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T00:16:36Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
